  },
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Supplier change decision record",
  "description": "Report known-as-of business state and fiscal 2027-2030 projections. Monetary integers use half-up end rounding at each requested output, tolerance one minor unit. Dates ISO YYYY-MM-DD. Stable ERP identifiers exact. Booleans strict. Additional evidence and recommendation unscored. Financial alternatives cover authorized suppliers other than the superseded incumbent; incumbent_reference_exposure is optional reference information. Gross exposure is before asset credit and historical payments or claims; disclose asset credit and refunds separately."
}
